							Yes toastie this is the real talbone no ebay here and WTH are u talking about Nosterafu I dont even know who u are and u want to bad mouth me on these boards , Los was camping the ER5 bracer in KC on the weekend we were there for 7 hours fighting , Then u have members from OA come and try to&nbsp; take our camp as well as another camp from another guild in that zone So, if u gonna start calling names&nbsp; around u better be posting some facts&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" />
