	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16067"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1109" title="View the profile of Hunnibun Sammich">Hunnibun Sammich</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 7<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/angel.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1109"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16067#msg16067"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1492.msg16067#msg16067">Re: Dang Fabled and being KSed</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> March 31, 2005, 06:03:28 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/dissappointed.gif" alt="dissappointed" border="0" />  Hello all.  Hunnibun here.<br /><br />It was interesting to read some of the funny and not so funny comments made.<br /><br />There was no &quot;ks&quot; here.   <br /><br />That was a wonderful post Eqsysquella.  I would say, in all honesty, We were 1/2 way between .33 and 1 minute and  40 seconds.  Which,  I would believe,  rates as &quot;patient enough&quot;<br /><br />I actually had enough time to look around and notice my old epic buddy standing next to the Fabled and the two corpses at the end of the hallway.  There was NO group engaged with the Fabled at that time.  I engaged the mob, he had kill me on his forehead, I couldn&#039;t resist.  <br /><br />When I realized my group was not with me.  I asked them,  in group,  where they were.  It was at that time I was informed they were dealing with a train.  I then took the mob with me,  up the ramp,  back to them.  When at that time two people not in my group started wailing on him.  So I question, who&#039;s pointing fingers at who.  <br /><br />I do apologise for any misunderstandings .   However, Inobu, I would think you would have many opportunities to take out this same Fabled for the rings you were planning on getting your guildies.  We only took one ring, from a mob that was standing around doing nothing.<br /><br />I am saddened by the comments that have been made by Nosterafu.  It appears,  by the other posts,  that he/she has made they are not very happy. There are  posts that are made with the same flavor, by this very same character.   There was something my mother taught me when I was young.  &quot;If you have nothing nice to say about someone.   Say nothing.&quot;  Its carried me well.<br /><br />Talbone is a person/character of the highest esteem.  He has been know to grind greens to help anyone level and or do faction grinding, and ldons, to insure someone got what they needed.  I feel honored to be able to be in the same guild with such a person.  I would in no way consider Talbone a &quot;clown&quot;.  Other than the fact he brings pleasantries and laughter to others, without expecting anything in return.<br /><br />Having said that,  I wish all of you safe journies through the land of Norrath.<br /><br />Regards to all <br /><br />Hunni<br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
