							Want facts how bout logs<br />Btw my clerics name is Breudayil<br />You say out of character, &#039;camp check&#039;<br />[Sun Mar 27 14:14:00 2005] Richardo says out of character, &#039;well&#039;<br />[Sun Mar 27 14:14:01 2005] Talbone says out of character, &#039;everything&#039;<br /><br />So I notice we have a clown in the house very amusing.<br /><br />[Sun Mar 27 14:14:34 2005] You say out of character, &#039;ok moving to warlord&#039;<br />[Sun Mar 27 14:14:48 2005] Talbone says out of character, &#039;lol i said everything means warlord too &#039;<br /><br />Ok whats so hard about stating which camp you have if this Talbone and crew are all this fuzzy good people they are then grow the hell up.<br /><br />[Sun Mar 27 14:26:37 2005] Kanashya says out of character, &#039;camp check please.&#039;<br />[Sun Mar 27 14:26:42 2005] Zilkorrn says out of character, &#039;well&#039;<br />[Sun Mar 27 14:26:50 2005] Talbone says out of character, &#039;what ever i see&#039;<br />[Sun Mar 27 14:26:55 2005] Icebabe says out of character, &#039;camping lavithon&#039;<br />[Sun Mar 27 14:27:02 2005] Talbone says out of character, &#039;camping mez&#039;<br /><br />Oh the comedy, I am rolling on the floor laughing now. I figure oh well get on the list for camp<br /><br />[Sun Mar 27 15:08:42 2005] You say out of character, &#039;second in list for wrist&#039;<br />[Sun Mar 27 15:09:02 2005] Talbone says out of character, &#039;how can u be second when we are camping it for whole guild?<br /><br />Ok now getting real pissed at this clown, and it continues.<br /><br />[Sun Mar 27 15:09:16 2005] Kanashya says out of character, &#039;you cant camp the whole place.&#039;<br />[Sun Mar 27 15:09:34 2005] Talbone says out of character, &#039;i can camp this room till fable no longer spawn&#039;<br /><br />Nice guy this Talbone<br /><br />
